WEBVTT

NOTE
Descriptive captions for the 20-second excerpt of Big Buck Bunny
(Blender Foundation, CC BY 3.0). The film has no dialogue.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
[A large rabbit stirs inside his burrow]

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.500
[He squeezes out into the morning light]

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:12.500
[He stretches beside the burrow]

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.000
[He strolls into the meadow]

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.500
[He breathes in the morning air and smiles]
